    "text": "Let a fully charged lead storage battery contains 1.5 L of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M&nbsp;</mi><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> . What will be the concentration of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> in the battery after 2.5 ampere current is drawn from the battery for 6 hour?",
