  "solution": {
    "text": "Number of moles of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> before electrolysis<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7.5</mn></math><br />Write cell rection <math><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />For 2 moles of electrons<br />2 moles of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> are used<br />Moles of electrons used <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>96500</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>96500</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.56</mn></math><br />Hence, moles of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> used <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.56</mn></math><br />Remaining mol of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.56</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6.94</mn></math><br />Final molarity <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6.94</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4.626</mn></math>",
